      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly i dont even know why im typing this. i just feel like im disappearing. like my whole life is just one long, endless cycle of taking care of everyone else and i have nothing left for myself. it’s like i’m underwater and i can’t find the surface. i look at my life and i don't even see a person anymore, just a set of tasks. i just want it to stop. i just want everything to be quiet for once.",
