      "content": "but how do i even start saving myself? everything is so tied together. if i stop, everything falls apart. if i take a break, or i just... don't show up, my kid suffers, my family suffers. it feels like i'm trapped in this cage and there's no way out that doesn't hurt someone else. it's just constant. i feel like there's no version of the future where i'm not just drowning.",
